OL,3,GNEWSA'Children should be safe from
OL,4,Agrooming gangs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham City Council has pledged to
OL,7,Ftest its safeguarding arrangements and
OL,8,Fimprove support after a national
OL,9,Finquiry into grooming gangs said it
OL,10,Fwould look at cases in the city.
OL,12,FIn a statement supported by the
OL,13,Fcouncil's coalition administration,
OL,14,Fcouncil leader Roger Harmer said
OL,15,Fchildren had been "let down by failures
OL,16,Fin safeguarding".
OL,18,FHe said every child deserved to be safe
OL,19,Fand every perpetrator should face
OL,20,Fjustice.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
