OL,3,GNEWSA'Children should be safe from
OL,4,Agrooming gangs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Independent Inquiry into Grooming
OL,7,FGangs said it would "examine the sexual
OL,8,Fabuse and exploitation of children by
OL,9,Fgrooming gangs and the response of
OL,10,Forganisations responsible for
OL,11,Fprotecting children".
